{
  "$schema": "./blender-material-mapping.schema.json (v0; informal)",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "updated": "2026-04-16",
  "description": "市政道路 v2（P7）用：Domain MaterialKey → Blender Principled BSDF 初始值映射模板。v1 不消费本文件，仅作为 schema 占位和未来 Blender Addon 读取。keys 与 Template.TemplatePoint.MaterialKey / TemplateComponent.MaterialKey 对齐。",
